# Database

- One schema owner per service. No cross-service writes (Setup still seeds `inventory` in places).
- Schema map: [docs/ai/database.md](../../docs/ai/database.md).
- Tables: PascalCase. Global `Glo*`. Tenant setup `FgsSetup*` or `Fgs*`. Do not create `FSGSetup*`.
- Tenant rows: `TenantId` + `CompanyId`, implement `ITenantCompanyScoped`. Global: `GloEntityBase`, no tenant columns.
- DbContext: inherit `FgsTenantFilteredDbContext`; register `AddFgsPersistence<TDbContext>()`; `UseFgsNpgsql`.
- Migrations live in `{Service}.Infrastructure/Database/Migrations`. Use that service's design factory.
- Reads in Setup: Dapper via `ISetupReadConnectionFactory` (`FgsSetupReadOnly`).
